<title>UK: CSFP sets $300 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>CSFP sets $300 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE FINANCIAL PRODUCTS</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    01.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.295   PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.92     SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT 2000 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
